{%- comment -%}
  FAEBRIQ 2026-09-10: was `assign target = product | default: product`, which
  assigned the variable to itself — a no-op that only worked because every caller
  happens to pass `product:`. Renders the passed product directly instead.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- if product.compare_at_price > product.price -%}
  <s class="fae-card__compare">{{ product.compare_at_price | money }}</s>
{%- endif -%}
<span>{{ product.price | money }}</span>
